@title Cooling what-if: a fix with fans carries the fan note
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The first fix of the hot cabinet adds an exhaust fan; its card carries the line about how the fan term was fitted. The line is small secondary text under the table and does not push the Apply button out of reach.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-advice.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
click_text "Cooling what-if"
wait 20
click_text "Try the fixes"
wait_s 120
expect "Devices over limit"
scroll 250 560 -150
wait 10
expect "under- or over-stated"
shot fan-note
check_layout
